                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]Parkour on top of trucks[/b] while doing tricks, earning points and listening to banger music. \nThis is a really fun first-person platformer in which the floor is lava and your platforms are moving trucks that bump into eachother, leading to a lot of great and really fun gameplay opportunities. The maps are fun and full of obstacles, both for you and the trucks. And you can also add power-ups to make your experience easier, or just different.\nOverall, this is a banger game, even though it can lead to some annoying moments when you have to retry a level over and over again. But don't worry, you'll get better at it and, hopefully, have lots of fun parkouring on trucks!",
